# ============================================================ # MASTER-CONSTITUTION for ALL 56 Specialists (v1.0.0) # ============================================================ # This template is used by ALL Specialists by reference. # Changes here apply to all 56 Specialists simultaneously. # ============================================================ # # Integration in Specialist-Recipe: #   # === MASTER-CONSTITUTION === #   # See: recipes/core/specialist-constitution.yaml #   # Specific deviations are documented below. # # ============================================================
# === CONSTITUTION (identical for ALL 56 Specialists) ===

